{"about_the_game":"Create images/textures based on fractals.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn Fractal Brush you can create images or textures that will surprise you not only when you have created them, but also when creating them!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFractal Brush has more than 100 patterns based on fractals that are the basis of its operation.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEach pattern is unique, so its behavior when generating fractals is also unique, and it takes a little practice to draw what you want.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIt also has the possibility of creating your own patterns and saving them to use them whenever you want.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTips:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n1 - Press the &quot;Esc&quot; key to access the main menu.<br />\r\n2 - Press the &quot;Q&quot; key to quickly access the brush menu.<br />\r\n3 - Press the &quot;E&quot; key to quickly access the brush settings.<br />\r\n4 - Press the &quot;Control&quot; + &quot;Z&quot; keys to undo.<br />\r\n5 - Press the &quot;Control&quot; + &quot;Shift&quot; + &quot;Z&quot; keys to redo.<br />\r\n6 - You can read these and more tips by pressing the &quot;TUTORIAL&quot; button.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWARNING: PHOTOSENSITIVE EPILEPSY SEIZURE RISK","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2659520?t=1745493782","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659520/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745493782","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659520/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745493782","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659520/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745493782","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"Create images/textures based on fractals.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn Fractal Brush you can create images or textures that will surprise you not only when you have created them, but also when creating them!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFractal Brush has more than 100 patterns based on fractals that are the basis of its operation.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEach pattern is unique, so its behavior when generating fractals is also unique, and it takes a little practice to draw what you want.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIt also has the possibility of creating your own patterns and saving them to use them whenever you want.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTips:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n1 - Press the &quot;Esc&quot; key to access the main menu.<br />\r\n2 - Press the &quot;Q&quot; key to quickly access the brush menu.<br />\r\n3 - Press the &quot;E&quot; key to quickly access the brush settings.<br />\r\n4 - Press the &quot;Control&quot; + &quot;Z&quot; keys to undo.<br />\r\n5 - Press the &quot;Control&quot; + &quot;Shift&quot; + &quot;Z&quot; keys to redo.<br />\r\n6 - You can read these and more tips by pressing the &quot;TUTORIAL&quot; button.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWARNING: PHOTOSENSITIVE EPILEPSY SEIZURE RISK","developers":["Krilitas"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Design & Illustration","id":"53"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659520/header.jpg?t=1745493782","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":256978007,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256978007/movie480.mp4?t=1698173259","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256978007/movie_max.mp4?t=1698173259"},"name":"Pincel de Fractales 1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256978007/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1698173259","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/25697800